    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As the CSR & Sustainability officer for we, I can confirm that we has a strong commitment to environmental sustainability. we have published a trajectory to reduce carbon intensity per managed assistant year on year, and we report deployment footprint to clients." ;
