    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "From a CSR perspective, we has a robust profile that includes a published CSR statement, an Ecovadis Silver rating, and a strong governance structure with a dedicated CSR lead reporting to the executive team. we prioritize sustainability in supplier selection and have conducted a bilan carbone assessment. we GHG scopes covered include scope 1, scope 2, and main scope 3 items, such as cloud inference." ;
