    <http://example.org/node/chunk146> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging we existing environmental capabilities and CSR commitments, we can ensure that our proposal meets the client's requirements for limiting environmental footprint and relying on low-carbon infrastructure, while also demonstrating we dedication to social responsibility and sustainability." ;
