    <http://example.org/node/chunk147> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our consortium proposes an artificial intelligence assistance solution, leveraging our flagship product Atelier, a sovereign platform that forges document-grounded AI assistants from an organisation's own documents. proposes aligns with Cabinet Vauclair & Associés' need for a non-decisional support tool that preserves professional secrecy and reliability of figures. our will utilise a hybrid delivery model, combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure, to work closely with the client and ensure the solution fits into the client existing practices. our past references, such as the regulatory-information assistant for a national professional order, demonstrate our understanding of the client sector and requirements. our partnership with Ligeo Conseil will facilitate seamless integration with the client production tools, including accounting-production software and document management systems. our flagship product Atelier, a sovereign platform that forges document-grounded AI assistants from an organisation's own documents provides quick access to reliable and up-to-date information drawn from accounting standards (PCG), tax doctrine, and the tax code (CGI), as well as internal procedures and methodology guides. our flagship product Atelier, a sovereign platform that forges document-grounded AI assistants from an organisation's own documents ensures answers are contextualised and grounded in cited sources, meeting the client's requirements for reliability and traceability of outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk148> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of drafting assistance, our template-guided drafting capability can aid in creating client letters, mission notes, file memos, and syntheses. our flagship product Atelier, a sovereign platform that forges document-grounded AI assistants from an organisation's own documents does not autonomously produce binding or signed deliverables; instead, our flagship product Atelier, a sovereign platform that forges document-grounded AI assistants from an organisation's own documents supports professionals in professionals daily activities while ensuring that the chartered accountant or statutory auditor remains the sole validator." ;
