    <http://example.org/node/chunk150> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This support is essential during the handling and review of client files, particularly during the révision des comptes. our flagship product Atelier, a sovereign platform that forges document-grounded AI assistants from an organisation's own documents also supports the preparation of recurring documents, ensuring efficiency and accuracy. our understand the importance of collaboration and mission continuity among Cabinet Vauclair & Associés' professionals. our flagship product Atelier, a sovereign platform that forges document-grounded AI assistants from an organisation's own documents facilitates the sharing of relevant information, enabling an understanding of the context of in-progress client files and efficient resumption by another collaborator." ;
