        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk153> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of security and compliance, our have ISO 27001 certification since 2023, demonstrating our commitment to protecting sensitive information. our are familiar with the anti-money-laundering framework (LCB-FT) and statutory audit principles, ensuring that our flagship product Atelier, a sovereign platform that forges document-grounded AI assistants from an organisation's own documents does not undermine the anti-money-laundering framework (LCB-FT) and statutory audit principles. our incident response plan includes detection, notification, and remediation procedures, aligning with the 72-hour GDPR breach-notification workflow. our budget approach favours cost-efficient tiers and models, such as the sovereign tier with the sovereign European model, to maintain a predictable and controlled annual operating cost for the client while preserving an acceptable margin for our." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk154> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client's budget of €220,000 over 3 years is well within our normal deal range and financial capacity. our are committed to environmental sustainability, partnering with green hosting providers like OuraneCloud, which offers sovereign hosting, renewable energy, and a power usage effectiveness (PUE) of 1.2. our digital sobriety practices, including model right-sizing, caching, and batching, contribute to reducing energy consumption. our also have the capability for carbon reporting, allowing our to monitor and optimize the environmental impact of our solutions. our proposed architecture, hosted on OuraneCloud SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure, integrates with the client's production tools via API-type interfaces, ensuring high availability, scalability, and low latency. our flagship product Atelier, a sovereign platform that forges document-grounded AI assistants from an organisation's own documents respects professional secrecy, confidentiality, and GDPR compliance, with strict access controls and auditing capabilities. our believe that our flagship product Atelier, a sovereign platform that forges document-grounded AI assistants from an organisation's own documents, combined with our expertise and commitment to sustainability, makes our an ideal partner for Cabinet Vauclair & Associés'. our flagship product Atelier, a sovereign platform that forges document-grounded AI assistants from an organisation's own documents improves productivity and quality of work while meeting the client's requirements for reliability, security, and professional secrecy. our look forward to collaborating with the client to deliver a successful project that meets the client needs and expectations." ;
